    94→  chart.svg         # exported SVG (optional but nice)
    95→  chart.png         # rasterized (optional)
    96→vendor/
    97→  d3.v7.9.0.min.js  # pinned D3 library
    98→```
    99→
   100→---
   101→
   102→## Interactive features (tooltips, click handlers, hover effects)
   103→
   104→When the task requires interactivity (e.g., tooltips on hover, click to highlight):
   105→
   106→### Tooltip pattern (recommended)
   107→
   108→1. **Create a tooltip element** in HTML:
   109→```html
   110→<div id="tooltip" class="tooltip"></div>
   111→```
   112→
   113→2. **Style with CSS** using `.visible` class for show/hide:
   114→```css
   115→.tooltip {
   116→    position: absolute;
   117→    padding: 10px;
   118→    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
   119→    color: white;
   120→    border-radius: 4px;
   121→    pointer-events: none;  /* Prevent mouse interference */
   122→    opacity: 0;
   123→    transition: opacity 0.2s;
   124→    z-index: 1000;
   125→}
   126→
   127→.tooltip.visible {
   128→    opacity: 1;  /* Show when .visible class is added */
   129→}
   130→```
   131→
   132→3. **Add event handlers** to SVG elements:
   133→```javascript
   134→svg.selectAll('circle')
   135→    .on('mouseover', function(event, d) {
   136→        d3.select('#tooltip')
   137→            .classed('visible', true)  // Add .visible class
   138→            .html(`<strong>${d.name}</strong><br/>${d.value}`)
   139→            .style('left', (event.pageX + 10) + 'px')
   140→            .style('top', (event.pageY - 10) + 'px');
   141→    })
   142→    .on('mouseout', function() {
   143→        d3.select('#tooltip').classed('visible', false);  // Remove .visible class
   144→    });
   145→```
   146→
   147→**Key points:**
   148→- Use `opacity: 0` by default (not `display: none`) for smooth transitions
   149→- Use `.classed('visible', true/false)` to toggle visibility
   150→- `pointer-events: none` prevents tooltip from blocking mouse events
   151→- Position tooltip relative to mouse with `event.pageX/pageY`
   152→
   153→### Click handlers for selection/highlighting
   154→
   155→```javascript
   156→// Add 'selected' class on click
   157→svg.selectAll('.bar')
   158→    .on('click', function(event, d) {
   159→        // Remove previous selection
   160→        d3.selectAll('.bar').classed('selected', false);
   161→        // Add to clicked element
   162→        d3.select(this).classed('selected', true);
   163→    });
   164→```
   165→
   166→CSS for highlighting:
   167→```css
   168→.bar.selected {
   169→    stroke: #000;
   170→    stroke-width: 3px;
   171→}
   172→```
   173→
   174→### Conditional interactivity
